  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" title=\"YouTube\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/EsvPsnqJpz\" title=\"Discord\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/pla_is_me\" title=\"Ko‑fi\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" title=\"github\">\n    <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n**Combat Evolution x EpicFight : Resurrection** 是一個用於在 **Combat Evolution** 與 **EpicFight : Resurrection** 之間增加相容性的附加模組。\n\n本模組會停用 EpicFight: Resurrection 內建的處決系統，並將其整合至 Combat Evolution 的處決機制。透過此模組，您可以在 Combat Evolution 的處決機制中使用來自 EpicFight : Resurrection 的處決動畫；此外，本模組也修復了 EpicFight Resurrection 中因 Yamato 導致的崩潰問題。\n\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 本模組是從 Annoying Villagers x EpicFight: Resurrection 分離出來的。</p>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ito-fUdAimY\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
